#: ../../source/user_guide/configuration.rst:36
msgid "**Source file** (without ``.rst`` extension)"
msgstr "**ソースファイル** （``.rst`` 拡張子なし）"

#: ../../source/user_guide/configuration.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Output filename stem** -- governs both the emitted ``.typ`` file and, "
"under the ``typstpdf`` builder, the compiled ``.pdf``. A literal trailing"
" ``.typ`` is stripped if present, and nothing else is, so a stem "
"containing a period such as ``v1.2-manual`` is preserved intact. A path "
"component is not supported: a path-bearing value produces a build warning"
" and the file is written under its basename next to the source document."
msgstr ""

